    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0945b5056e088b37e973411",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迷人景致。走在后冠路线上，\n如今也活跃在古马级的，\n一名开朗纯粹的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8223b3da13a42bff713246c178f07bf325a0276b72632209b1251efa5ad49706",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
