    {
      "uid": "zhcn:16bb5b1c96dc1fa20abdf8b6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目前战绩是GⅠ4胜，\n有着从未跌出过前五的坚实实力。\n而更值得一提的是――",
      "source_fingerprint": "8db9dff037b39502a3ab4d63792451913e5d4d568f84f4c6a3d01420f639d497",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143104.json",
      "json_path": [
